{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"154329","name":"Palais Sheherazade","description":"The luxurious Palais Sheherazade is set in a beautiful palace in the heart of the new town district in Fez. The famous attractions of Fes el Bali, such as the “Blue Gate” of Fez and Bou Inania Madrasa, are only a ten-minute drive away, and business travellers will find many government and corporate offices nearby. The exquisitely decorated rooms will make guests feel as though they are living One Thousand and One Nights with hand-embroidered silks, decorative carved wooden doors and furnishings, and views of the interior courtyard, Andalusian garden, or terrace. Guests can go for a swim in the outdoor pool after a busy day of sightseeing, or get a massage and relax in the Turkish bath. The hotel is famous for its garden terrace restaurant which serves refined Moroccan cuisine in an elegant atmosphere, and guests can enjoy Moroccan tea and pastries upon arrival. For a romantic getaway to Fez, this hotel provides a magical stay.","address":"23 Arsat Benis Douh Medina Fes, 23","city":"FEZ","countryCode":"MA","postalCode":"30000","lat":34.058861,"lng":-4.978776,"stars":5,"giataCode":"89061","phone":"00212535741642","email":"sheheraz@menara.ma","website":"www.sheheraz.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/154329/154329a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/154329/154329a_hb_a_002_20260307_145516.jpeg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/154329/154329a_hb_a_003_20260307_145517.jpeg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/154329/154329a_hb_a_004_20260307_145518.jpeg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/154329/154329a_hb_l_001.jpg","category":"lobby","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/15/154329/154329a_hb_w_001.jpg","cat